# A small dimensioned plan, in millimetres. Each command selects its output.
UNITS 4
LAYER Walls
RECTANGLE 0 0 1200 800
OFFSET -20

# Twelve columns, with counts including the original circle.
LAYER Columns
CIRCLE 100 100 15
ARRAYRECT 4 3 300 300

LAYER Annotations
TEXT 30 840 25 0 Workspace plan
DIM H 0 0 1200 0 0 -70
DIM V 1200 0 1200 800 1270 0
SELECT ALL
